      "message": "We should also add the ACL logging for allowing an easier troubleshooting of common permission issues, as we do for all of the other permissions evaluations.\n\nExample:\n```\n    if (logger.atFine().isEnabled() || LoggingContext.getInstance().isAclLogging()) {\n      String logMessage \u003d\n          String.format(\n              \"\u0027%s\u0027 cannot perform \u0027%s\u0027 on project \u0027%s\u0027 for ref \u0027%s\u0027\",\n              getUser().getLoggableName(),\n              permissionName,\n              withForce,\n              projectControl.getProject().getName(),\n              refName);\n      LoggingContext.getInstance().addAclLogRecord(logMessage);\n      logger.atFine().log(\"%s\", logMessage);\n    }\n```",
